      "id": "AC2",
      "text": "Comparing a rendered page with a misplaced region and a missing scoped label reports `region` and `missing` rows and sets `passed` to false."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC3",
      "text": "Unsafe `.ui.svg` reference markup fails with `unsafe-reference-svg`, and an invalid comparison report fails formatting with `invalid-comparison-report`."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC4",
      "text": "Formatting a comparison report produces a Markdown `Screen vs drawing` table that escapes special characters in labels."
    }
  ],
